<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL 2002 issues AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL 2002 issues AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Tuesday it assigned a long-term rating of AAA to DSL Bank's 250 million Swiss franc 3.25 percent notes due 2002 and to DSL Finance NV's 250 million mark five percent notes due 2002, guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank.</p>
<p>&quot;The ratings are based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
